@baseUrl = https://localhost:7123

### 1. Get All Businesses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/businesses
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a Business
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/businesses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Corp",
  "document": "12345678000199"
}

### 3. Get Payment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Payment for Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/business/1/invoice/INV-2026-001
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Get Latest Payment for Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/business/1/invoice/INV-2026-001/latest
Accept: application/json